e", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "Molecular Signatures \nDatabase", "normalizedForm": "Molecular Signatures Database", "offsetStart": 78, "offsetEnd": 108, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 6, "x": 418.584, "y": 514.43, "w": 85.41909999999996, "h": 8.63760000000002}, {"p": 6, "x": 108.0, "y": 525.389, "w": 36.5129, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "Molecular Signatures Database", "context": "There are 121 labels for each node set from gene ontology, collected from the Molecular Signatures Database , and a node can possess several labels simultaneously.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.7336637377738953}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.22483019530773163}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.04150605574250221}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.7336637377738953}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.22483019530773163}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.04150605574250221}}}, {"rawForm": "PPI dataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "PPI dataset", "normalizedForm": "PPI dataset", "offsetStart": 265, "offsetEnd": 276, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 340.138, "y": 140.133, "w": 42.92256666666668, "h": 8.637599999999992}]}, "normalizedForm": "PPI dataset", "context": "The other transductive approaches are either completely inappropriate in an inductive setting or assume that nodes are incrementally added to a single graph, making them unusable for the setup where test graphs are completely unseen during training (such as the PPI dataset).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.33328908681869507}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.5093902349472046}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.15732067823410034}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.6017146706581116}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.5093902349472046}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.15732067823410034}}}, {"rawForm": "Cora dataset", "type": "dataset-name